{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And also</b> — The sense is speaking to the man mentioned above; rather, 'the man' refers to each one of the wealthy of the city: if you committed violence and sickened the hearts of the oppressed, I too have sickened you; I struck you and made you desolate."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:09.194540762Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}